Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:38:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] trx-4s9s.25: preserve non-visual PPTX extensions and picture
 omission

Retain relationship-free cNvPr entries with namespace bindings through the model and writer instead of discarding add-in identities. Keep source omission of rotWithShape without changing explicit values or new-picture serialization. Add failing-then-passing public-API regressions and document scoped headless sldr round-trip proof.
